<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>The Okhotsk Bastion, 1961</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;With Kennedy ordering&amp;nbsp;a more aggressive naval policy, the Soviets have responded with one of their largest anti-submarine operations. This scenario features hypothetical Soviet aircraft carrier and naval aircraft designs being deployed against the American undersea force.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Notes: &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Make sure to set "Unlimited Aircraft Ordnance" to "Yes" if it is not already checked. While the magazines have been filled, the scenario was intended to be played with that option in place.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Soviet warship names in&amp;nbsp;the scenario&amp;nbsp;are a mixture of historical and fictional ones.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;-Scenario by Coiler12&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;-Special thanks to Randomizer for invaluable input.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
